Digital is mean with licenses.  You'd have to pay a rather large license
transfer fee (about $300 I think).  The Digital rep I talked to didn't
even know if they still sold Ultrix licences but he did eventually give
me a few places that should and none of them had it.  However, he almost
got upset when I asked him if the licenses were still valid and if they
