NetBSD is currently available.  It just doesn't support the standard
console and you need to use the serial port as a console.  I've also
been seeing messages that a group will be porting Linux to the VAX, but
that isn't even really started yet.  
For info on the NetBSD port, take a look at:
http://www.bitcon.no/~gunnar/vaxbsd/FAQ.html
