This does not have anything to do with the 32-bit protected mode.

The problem with the PLUS functions (animated cursors) has been traced
to a problem with Reachout. In the SYSTEM.INI file in the [386Enh]
section there are four lines (statements) that contain the word
REACHOUT. Remove or comment out these lines and then save and reboot.
