further also hangs.  A ps listing for that user or tty hangs, top hangs,
dbx hangs.  This was a 3.2 system that was recently upgraded to 4.0B 
(via 4.0).  This filesystem was left as it was during the upgrade.

I was able to mount it read only with the -d flag and save everything
to tape, then newfs and reload it but I have other 3.2 created ufs
filesystems.  Is there a problem with 4.0B and 3.2 filesystems?  Should
I rebuild my other filesystems?  Could there still be a problem with
the disk and I need to run more diagnostics?

Cheers,



