The Alpha Multia runs Windows NT for Alpha - no emulation. While the
Multia software only includes support for Windows NT up to V3.51 SP4,
you can run Windows NT V4.0 (without the Multia bits) on Alpha Multias
- they are listed in the NT Hardware Compatibility List.

As far as the special Multia software is concerned, some of its
functionality is already in Win NT V4.0, some in the MS System
Management Server, and other parts (or alternatives to them) are
available from 3rd parties. There is also a "Multia Enterprise Desktop
Migration Guide" which has all the details.

Hope this helps,

