>  gcc compiling)

Dunno.  Haven't had two machines around to benchmark.

>* Any guess/knowledge about how fast a 21164pc system will be?

DEC is claiming ~15SpecINT95, ~20SpecFP95 for these.
PC164 gets about 14/14 w/ 2M of cache.

