disk, you can init it as that disk (TEST 70 or TEST 73 from the console >>>
prompt, I forget which). If you want to define a new drive type to get the
maximum capacity from your drive, you have to input some weird MSCP param-
eters, the meaning of which is undocumented and obscure.

