If the controller has a 5 connection power socket, then what you have there is a
DSSI controller, not SCSI.  DSSI is/was DECs propriatory interface, and will not
work on a SCSI bus without another adapter. I do not know the spec for the 5th
connection (the first 4 are normal 5 and 12 volt dc w/grounds).

