You can on IRIX, on the following platforms:
	Power Challenge R8000 under IRIX 6.0, 6.0.1, 6.1, 6.2
	Power Indigo2 R8000 under IRIX 6.0, 6.0.1, 6.1, 6.2
	Indigo2 R10000 running IRIX 6.2
	Challenge running IRIX 6.2
