   Tip: the way to make a popular web page is not to have a few
random little things, a bunch of links, and definitely NOT spamming
all sorts of crap all over the net for advertising. It boils down
to pretty much one concept: well organized content. With that, the
www search engines will do a good job of figuring out exactly what's
easily accessible your site, and make it available to all. You put
up a lot of unlinked crud with bad html, and you'll be ignored.

