If you are getting an occasional unaligned access, and you simply want
to block the notification, run the uac program.  There is a man page for
it.  If you are generating lots of unaligned accesses, then you are
potentially wasting a lot of compute resources doing the fix ups.  This
indicates that you should re-examine your source code for the problem.



