: dinosaur) but, from what i've read, DEC seems to out-perform Sun by a long
: shot. does anyone have any specific grips about Suns which i could use to fuel
: my pro-DEC stance with the accounts manager? the latter chap wants to run a
: line of Pentiums: apart from the social stigma of doing high volume fp and int
: scientific work on a Pentium, from what i can see the PC is a donkey compared
