The RZ26L definitely supports sync.  Unfortunately, I don't think DEC 
still owns the documentation for it.  It was sold to Quantum in 1994.
You might try asking them for documentation on the RZ26L (or its
fraternal twin, the DSP3107L).  

The RZ26 was two years earlier; it also supported synchronous transfers.



