Unfortunately, their Fortran compiler seems to mix up 32/64-bitness with 
language features.  Try to compile the following on a R4{0,4,6}000 base IRIX 
6.2 system with the resident f77 compiler:

      subroutine aap(noot)
      integer noot
      real a(noot)
      end

