>>> TEST 75
ScsHDerase
PV_SCS_FMT_CHN (0=SCSIA, 1=SCSIB)           select scsi a or b with 0 or 1
PV_SCS_FMT_ID (0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7)             select device number
PV_SCS_FMT_RUSURE (1/0)                     select 1 to proceed

